  "_design": "The land runs out. Grass, then a rock shoulder, then sand, then a beach cut into pockets by tide channels nobody can wade yet. The spit at y20 is the only way to what sits on the end of it, and it is in plain sight from the road for half the walk down.",
  "_plan": "The last road, down off the shelf and out onto the coast. The sea takes the whole east side and the beach widens as the ground falls, so the map ends in water rather than in trees."
